<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>CMO | Lawn Care • Trash Can Cleaning • Car Wash</title>

<style>
:root{
  --green:#18b95a;
  --dark:#071b13;
  --lime:#b7ff45;
  --blue:#16a7ff;
  --white:#fff;
  --muted:#d8eee3;
}

*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
  scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  background:#06150f;
  color:white;
}

header{
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:20;
  background:rgba(6,21,15,.92);
  backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
  border-bottom:1px solid #204c39;
}

nav{
  max-width:1100px;
  margin:auto;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  padding:15px 20px;
}

.logo{
  font-size:28px;
  font-weight:1000;
  color:var(--lime);
  letter-spacing:2px;
}

nav a{
  color:white;
  text-decoration:none;
  margin-left:18px;
  font-weight:800;
}

.hero{
  min-height:78vh;
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  text-align:center;
  padding:70px 20px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%,#17683f 0,#09291c 35%,#06150f 75%);
}

.badge{
  display:inline-block;
  background:var(--lime);
  color:#071b13;
  padding:9px 15px;
  border-radius:999px;
  font-weight:1000;
}

.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(50px,10vw,100px);
  margin:18px 0 5px;
  line-height:.9;
}

.hero h1 span{
  color:var(--lime);
}

.hero p{
  font-size:21px;
  color:var(--muted);
  max-width:720px;
  margin:20px auto;
}

.buttons{
  display:flex;
  gap:12px;
  justify-content:center;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.btn{
  display:inline-block;
  padding:15px 22px;
  border-radius:14px;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:1000;
}

.primary{
  background:var(--lime);
  color:#071b13;
}

.secondary{
  border:2px solid #65d99a;
  color:white;
}

section{
  max-width:1100px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:70px 20px;
}

h2{
  text-align:center;
  font-size:42px;
  margin:0 0 12px;
}

.sub{
  text-align:center;
  color:var(--muted);
  margin:0 auto 35px;
  max-width:650px;
}

.grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:20px;
}

.card{
  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0d2b1e,#092016);
  border:1px solid #24573f;
  border-radius:22px;
  padding:28px;
  box-shadow:0 15px 35px #0005;
}

.icon{
  font-size:48px;
}

.card h3{
  font-size:25px;
  margin:10px 0;
}

.price{
  font-size:30px;
  font-weight:1000;
  color:var(--lime);
}

.card p{
  color:var(--muted);
  line-height:1.6;
}

.highlight{
  background:linear-gradient(100deg,#0f6f40,#0878a8);
  border-radius:28px;
  padding:38px;
  text-align:center;
}

.highlight h2{
  font-size:38px;
}

.steps{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:15px;
}

.step{
  padding:22px;
  border-radius:18px;
  background:#0c2419;
}

.num{
  font-size:34px;
  color:var(--lime);
  font-weight:1000;
}

.contact{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:22px;
}

.contactbox{
  background:#0b2419;
  border:1px solid #24573f;
  border-radius:22px;
  padding:28px;
}

.phone{
  display:block;
  color:var(--lime);
  font-size:25px;
  font-weight:1000;
  text-decoration:none;
  margin:12px 0;
}

footer{
  text-align:center;
  padding:35px 20px;
  border-top:1px solid #204c39;
  color:#9bc5b0;
}

@media(max-width:750px){

  .grid,
  .steps,
  .contact{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  nav a{
    display:none;
  }

  .hero{
    min-height:70vh;
  }

  h2{
    font-size:34px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<nav>
<div class="logo">CMO ⚡</div>

<div>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#how">How It Works</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</div>

</nav>
</header>

<main>

<section class="hero">

<div>

<div class="badge">
MICHAEL + MASON • LOCAL SERVICE
</div>

<h1>
CMO<br>
<span>GET IT CLEAN.</span>
</h1>

<p>
Lawn care, trash can cleaning, and car washing —
done by Michael & Mason with pride, energy,
and attention to detail.
</p>

<div class="buttons">

<a class="btn primary" href="#contact">
📲 Book a Service
</a>

<a class="btn secondary" href="#services">
🔥 See Services
</a>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="services">

<h2>What We Do 🧼</h2>

<p class="sub">
Simple neighborhood services that make your home,
cans, lawn, and ride look way better.
</p>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">

<div class="icon">🌱</div>

<h3>Lawn Care</h3>

<p>
Mowing, edging, trimming, cleanup,
and making your yard look fresh.
</p>

<div class="price">
Starting at $20
</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="icon">🗑️</div>

<h3>Trash Can Cleaning</h3>

<p>
We clean and freshen your trash cans
so they don't stay nasty after pickup day.
</p>

<div class="price">
Starting at $10
</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="icon">🚗</div>

<h3>Car Washing</h3>

<p>
Exterior wash and cleanup to get your
car looking clean and ready to roll.
</p>

<div class="price">
Starting at $15
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section>

<div class="highlight">

<h2>
Bundle & Save 🔥
</h2>

<p>
Need more than one service?
Ask Michael or Mason about a custom
neighborhood bundle.
</p>

<a class="btn primary" href="#contact">
Get a Quote
</a>

</div>

</section>


<section id="how">

<h2>
How It Works
</h2>

<p class="sub">
No complicated booking process.
Just hit us up.
</p>

<div class="steps">

<div class="step">

<div class="num">01</div>

<h3>Contact CMO</h3>

<p>
Call Michael or Mason and tell us
what you need.
</p>

</div>


<div class="step">

<div class="num">02</div>

<h3>Pick a Time</h3>

<p>
We'll work out a time that fits
both sides.
</p>

</div>


<div class="step">

<div class="num">03</div>

<h3>We Get It Done</h3>

<p>
We show up, do the job,
and leave it looking better.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<section id="contact">

<h2>
Ready to Get Started? 📲
</h2>

<p class="sub">
CMO is founded by Michael & Mason.
Reach out for pricing and scheduling.
</p>

<div class="contact">

<div class="contactbox">

<h3>Michael</h3>

<a class="phone" href="tel:7325750303">
732-575-0303
</a>

<p>
Call or text Michael for service
questions and scheduling.
</p>

</div>


<div class="contactbox">

<h3>Mason</h3>

<a class="phone" href="tel:6099012860">
609-901-2860
</a>

<p>
Call or text Mason for service
questions and scheduling.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</section>

</main>


<footer>

© 2026 CMO • Michael & Mason
• Lawn Care • Trash Can Cleaning • Car Washing

</footer>

</body>
</html>